"name": "Valley National Bancorp",
"description": "Valley National Bancorp is a bank and financial holding company, which engages in the provision of retail and commercial banking services. It operates through the following segments: Commercial Banking, Consumer Banking, and Treasury and Corporate Other. The Commercial Banking segment includes commercial and industrial loans, and commercial real estate loans. The Consumer Banking segment refers to residential mortgage loans, other consumer loans, and wealth management. The Treasury and Corporate Other segment relates to treasury held to maturity and available for sale debt securities portfolios. The company was founded in 1927 and is headquartered in New York, NY.",
